    "sections": {
        "description": "StoryFrame is a clean, image-first portfolio theme for photographers and visual creatives. It offers switchable masonry, grid, and justified gallery layouts, an optional EXIF detail badge pulled from your media library, project/case-study pages for showing process work, light and dark viewing modes, and simple client-side favouriting for sharing password-protected proofing pages with clients. Fully responsive, keyboard accessible, and translation ready."
